export anchor RawHTMLStyle:
    number: 47
    screen: Settings
    name: Raw HTML
    idea: The page looks almost unstyled, like hand-written HTML from the late 1990s, with Times, blue underlined links, grey bevel buttons, rules and bordered tables.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page and fields
        black: #000000, all text and the dotted focus outline
        linkBlue: #0000ee, unvisited links, always underlined
        visitedPurple: #551a8b, visited links
        buttonGrey: #c0c0c0, buttons, table header cells and bevels
        shadowGrey: #808080, rules and bevel shade
        darkBevel: #404040, the outer shadow edge of buttons
        warningYellow: #ffff99, the WARNING cell in the danger table
    type:
        Browser default serif, Times New Roman, Times, Liberation Serif,
        serif, 16px at 1.25. The brand is 32px bold with a small italic
        line under it. The page title is the default h1 at 32px bold,
        sections are h2 at 24px bold, sub sections h3 at 19px bold.
        Controls use Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif at 13px. Captions and the
        footer are small italic.
    layout:
        No layout beyond the flow. A borderless header table puts the brand
        left and Logged in as Mara Okafor right. A grooved rule, then the
        sections as links in square brackets split by bars, with the
        current one bold between double arrows. Then Settings, Notifications,
        a Changes saved line, a full width bordered table of settings with
        columns for setting, checkbox and status, the selects on their own
        lines, a fieldset of inline radios, two buttons, a rule, the danger
        table and a small address footer.
    spacing: Browser defaults. 8px body margin, normal paragraph gaps, 4px cell padding, 2px cell spacing.
    density: Dense and long. Everything flows top to bottom.
    corners: Square, always.
    borders: Tables use a 2px outset border with 1px inset cells. Rules are a 1px grey line over a white line. The final rule is 4px solid black.
    shadows: None. Buttons are bevelled with white top left edges and dark grey bottom right edges, inverted when pressed.
    icons:
        None. Text symbols only, a check mark before Changes saved, a
        warning sign beside WARNING and double arrows around the current
        section. On and off show as native checkboxes plus the words ON or
        off in italic.
    focus: A 2px dotted black outline offset 2px.
    tone: Literal and a bit stiff, such as Logged in as, WARNING! and Table 1. Notifications.
